      "title": "ChatGPT arrives",
      "caption": "Late 2022. ChatGPT joins the browser for questions from time to time. Same tab bar, a different kind of answer.",
      "body": "At first it was a better search box: explain this error, what does this API do, write a regex. The answer still had to be read, judged, and typed over by hand.",
      "ops": [
        {
          "op": "add",
          "node": {
            "id": "chatgpt",
            "label": "ChatGPT",
