            "to": "chatgpt",
            "style": "dashed",
            "label": "asks"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The clipboard loop",
      "caption": "Code goes from chat to editor and back. Paste the function in, paste the error out, repeat until it runs.",
      "body": "This was the first real workflow change: the chat became a second editor without a file system. Every round trip was manual, and context was whatever fit in the paste.",
