    {
      "title": "mi and the skills repo",
      "caption": "March 2026. mi, a minimal self-extending harness, and a skills repo that any harness can load. Skills become the unit of reuse.",
      "body": "Instead of teaching each tool separately, the know-how moved into skills: discipline, bugbash, integration testing, ideate. mi was the smallest harness that could load them.",
